(When a physical button is pressed, its metallic contacts rapidly connect and disconnect multiple times before) Tj
T* (settling into a stable state. Without a debounce mechanism, a microcontroller will register these bounces as) Tj
T* (multiple rapid button presses, causing erratic behavior like multiple LED toggles from a single press.) Tj
